href='https://www.nconemap.gov/pages/parcels' rel='nofollow ugc'>NC OneMap parcels page<\/a><span style='color:black;'>.  Airport property boundaries were determined by reviewing the latest\nAirport Layout Plan and through direct communication with the airport manager,\ndirector, or geospatial representative.  Airport boundary data\ncollection took place from November 2023 - February 2024 and may not contain\nall data that is available.  <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\n<p style='margin:12pt 0in; background-image:initial; background-position:initial; background-size:initial; background-repeat:initial; background-attachment:initial; background-origin:initial; background-clip:initial; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; text-align:start; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; word-spacing:0px;'><font color='#000000' size='3' style='background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);'><b><span style='font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;'>User Considerations:<\/span><\/b><span style='font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;'> \n <\/span><\/font><\/p>\n\n<p style='margin-top:12.0pt; margin-right:0in; margin-bottom:12.0pt; margin-left:0in; background:white; font-variant-ligatures:normal; font-variant-caps:normal; text-align:start; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; word-spacing:0px;'><span style='font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; color:black;'>This\ndataset reflects the airport property information at the time of the\npublication.  The boundary data are not the result of an actual boundary\nsurvey by a licensed professional land surveyor.   The visual display\nof geographical information is provided &quot;as is&quot;, &quot;as\navailable&quot;, and &quot;with all faults&quot;.  Primary sources from\nwhich this data was compiled must be consulted for verification of information\ncontained.  <\/span><\/p>\n\n<p style='margin-top:12.0pt; margin-right:0in; margin-bottom:12.0pt; margin-left:0in; background:white; font-variant-ligat